<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="GREENE PINE Youth Wealth Club - Learn. Invest. Grow. Lead. Join a movement focused on financial literacy, entrepreneurship, and leadership development." />
  <title>GREENE PINE Youth Wealth Club</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --green-dark: #06281E;
      --green: #0B3D2E;
      --gold: #C9A227;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --muted: #b7b7b7;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--green-dark);
      color: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      padding: 90px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-dark), var(--green));
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 56px;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .tagline {
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.85;
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    section {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--green);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .form-container {
      background: var(--green);
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    label {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: bold;
      display: block;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      outline: none;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      background: var(--gold);
      border: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    button:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .faq {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: #041a13;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .whatsapp {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      color: var(--gold);
    }
  </style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>GREENE PINE</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Learn. Invest. Grow. Lead.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="#apply">Apply Now</a>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>
    GREENE PINE is a youth wealth and leadership movement focused on transforming young people into
    financially literate, entrepreneurial, and disciplined leaders through practical education and real-world experience.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>What We Offer</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">Financial Literacy Training</div>
    <div class="card">Entrepreneurship Development</div>
    <div class="card">Investment Education</div>
    <div class="card">Leadership Building</div>
    <div class="card">Real Business Projects</div>
    <div class="card">Mentorship & Networking</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Why Join GREENE PINE?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Practical money and business skills</li>
    <li>Real-world project experience</li>
    <li>Leadership and discipline training</li>
    <li>Mentorship and networking opportunities</li>
    <li>Early path to entrepreneurship and investing</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="apply">
  <h2>Membership Application</h2>
  <p>Fill in the form below to apply for membership.</p>

  <div class="form-container">
    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Application submitted successfully. We will contact you soon.');">

```
  <label>Full Name</label>
  <input type="text" required />

  <label>Email Address</label>
  <input type="email" required />

  <label>Phone Number</label>
  <input type="text" required />

  <label>Age</label>
  <input type="number" required />

  <label>Why do you want to join?</label>
  <textarea rows="4" required></textarea>

  <button type="submit">Submit Application</button>
</form>
```

  </div>

  <p class="faq">
    Need help? Contact us on WhatsApp:
    <br />
    <a class="whatsapp" href="#">Chat with GREENE PINE Support</a>
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  © GREENE PINE Youth Wealth Club | Learn. Invest. Grow. Lead.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
